# nexora-action-code: get_interface_brief
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+\s+[0-9\/\.\:\-_]+|\S+)
Value STATUS (connected|notconnect|disabled|err-disabled|administratively down|admin down|down|up|Down|Up|\S+)
Value VLAN (\d+|routed|trunk|unassigned|\S+)
Value DUPLEX (full|half|auto|a-full|a-half|Full|Half|Auto|Unknown|unknown|--|\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value TYPE (.+?)

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ -> Next
  ^(?:Interface|Port)\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type -> Begin
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next

Begin
  ^-+ -> Next
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
